    <string name="about_title">Zeitreise</string>
    <string name="about_body">Spin the globe, open a country, explore its states and the places worth a visit, travel back through the centuries, or test yourself in the globe quiz. Zeitreise runs on Android, iOS and the web from one Kotlin Multiplatform codebase.</string>
    <string name="about_credits_heading">Data and credits</string>
    <string name="about_credit_wikipedia">Place descriptions and facts: Wikipedia, under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike licence (CC BY-SA). Articles are found through Wikidata.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_ai">With a Gemini API key, the AI guide writes its stories from the Wikipedia article alone.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_natural_earth">Country, state and province outlines: Natural Earth, in the public domain.</string>
